  "description": "Part 3 of South Park: The Stick of Truth! I'm Lelac, aka BaoChickaWowWow, and after a little break I'm back to finish assembling Cartman's army.\n\nI finally buy a gas mask to get past that pepper spray, Cartman teaches me magic (it's farts, the magic is farts), and we break into South Park Elementary to bust Craig out of Mr. Mackey's detention, fighting our way through an army of hall monitors for the brass, silver and gold keys. And for my efforts... I've been promoted to Sir Douchebag.\n\nLet me know in the comments if you want me to do more side quests next time!\n\nIf you enjoyed it, like and subscribe so you don't miss Part 4.\n\nCHAPTERS\n{CHAPTERS}\n\n#BaoChickaWowWow #SouthPark #StickOfTruth #SouthParkStickOfTruth #LetsPlay #Gameplay #FirstPlaythrough #Part3",
